"op":"add","path":"/metadata/completed_at","value":"2026-11-10T14:35:37.677Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/resolution","value":"New core/shared/url-credentials.ts holds the conservative token rule (the span between the first ':' and the last '@'), exported through the SDK as redactUrlCredentialsInToken/redactUrlCredentialsInText/URL_CREDENTIAL_PLACEHOLDER. cli/runtime/refusal-credential-redaction.ts redacts typed refusals (main.ts, before formatting, accounting, telemetry and Sentry) and Commander usage errors (JSON before lean projection and output-token accounting, text before help_format). It replaces exact raw and shell-quoted spellings, applies the token rule to argv fields and the word rule to text, withholds a changed suggested_retry/suggested_retry_args, and adds a restore-credentials next step. history redact flag-value redaction is unchanged."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"CLI refusals no longer print URL credentials from the invocation"}],"before_hash":"bbae8e526e94d5324a0975fcf68687a423fb83acc998d5d3d3b2146ea264972b","after_hash":"3921383a9cc90e409c91f2cf84c49a4363baa754d8703d813ff9fb76767e4b80","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-10T14:35:37.677Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"999af4771720d2e541c4151fc99a50a299014c436c82f03e80614116a6dd2a2d"}
